# External Dataset Evaluation

To further validate the generalization capability of the proposed classification model and address the reviewers' comments regarding dataset bias, an additional evaluation was conducted using an independent external dataset consisting of real-world plant leaf images. Unlike the PlantVillage dataset, these images include variations in illumination, complex backgrounds, occlusions, and other environmental factors, making the classification task significantly more challenging.

The same classification model proposed in this study (originally trained on the PlantVillage dataset) was evaluated on this external dataset without modifying its architecture.

